# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Video build (Task 25). The SOURCE ships; the toolchain and the render do not.
# node_modules is 249 packages, and the MP4 is a build output -- both are
# reproducible from video/package.json and the committed data.
# build-provenance.json DOES ship: it records the environment that produced the
# artifact, and provenance that does not ship is not provenance (INC-011).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
video/node_modules/
video/out/
video/.remotion/

# The Remotion project. The rendered video is uploaded to YouTube and linked
# from the form; the source went with it on 2026-09-04 at the builder's
# instruction. Consequence, stated rather than discovered later: every video
# guard (test_video_no_literals, test_render_provenance, the video half of
# test_claims_uncompressed and test_mde_labelling) SKIPS on a checkout without
# it, so those run on the render machine and not in CI.
video/
